# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large binary media — DO NOT commit. ~8.8 GB of geotagged field photos and
# safari videos live under public/media/. These belong in object storage /
# a CDN, not in git history. Keep them locally for dev; serve from a bucket
# in production.
#
# NOTE: 125 files already committed under public/media/photos/ are NOT
# untracked by this rule — they need `git rm --cached` to remove from the
# index (kept on disk). We'll do that as a separate step.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
public/media/
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
